==Battleground==
*3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s (400%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Otta-smack-u]]s (400%) spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A decent meatshield and melee-midrange attacker should be able to deal with this stage rather easily. There is a lot of Otter spam, but a unit like [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Flying Cat]] can deal with this well enough.

